    "title": "Kick & Break The Ragdoll Games",
    "description": "<b><font color=\"blue\">WHAT YOU NEED TO DO!</font></b>\r\n\r\nIn the mission-oriented Ragdoll Game, your task is to strategically smash the ragdoll by hitting it with the hurdles. It is a physics based game for your enjoyment.\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"blue\">Seeking a cool and entertaining game for your playtime?</font></b>\r\n\r\nOur kick & break the ragdoll game stands out as an optimal choice. Experience the ultimate Ragdoll Physics as you engage in breaking, smashing, and de-stressing, making it one of the cool ragdoll games available.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f<b><font color=\"blue\">Have fun breaking the ragdoll!</font></b>\ud83e\udd20\r\n\r\nPlayflix presents a stress relief game for you named as Kick & Break The Ragdoll Games in which you have to crush, throw, punch \ud83e\udd4a and kick to break the doll. Enjoy the calming feeling as you dismantle the doll, and feel your stress melt away. Let's break bones!\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"blue\">FEATURES</font></b>\r\n\ud83e\udd1d Innovative Level Design with real challenges\r\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f A Physics based game\r\n\ud83e\udd18  Fun, Relaxation, Stress Relief and destruction game\r\n\ud83e\udd20 Customizable Ragdoll Character to be braked",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b><font color=\"blue\">WHAT YOU NEED TO DO!</font></b><br><br>In the mission-oriented Ragdoll Game, your task is to strategically smash the ragdoll by hitting it with the hurdles. It is a physics based game for your enjoyment.<br><br><b><font color=\"blue\">Seeking a cool and entertaining game for your playtime?</font></b><br><br>Our kick &amp; break the ragdoll game stands out as an optimal choice. Experience the ultimate Ragdoll Physics as you engage in breaking, smashing, and de-stressing, making it one of the cool ragdoll games available.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f<b><font color=\"blue\">Have fun breaking the ragdoll!</font></b>\ud83e\udd20<br><br>Playflix presents a stress relief game for you named as Kick &amp; Break The Ragdoll Games in which you have to crush, throw, punch \ud83e\udd4a and kick to break the doll. Enjoy the calming feeling as you dismantle the doll, and feel your stress melt away. Let&#39;s break bones!<br><br><b><font color=\"blue\">FEATURES</font></b><br>\ud83e\udd1d Innovative Level Design with real challenges<br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f A Physics based game<br>\ud83e\udd18  Fun, Relaxation, Stress Relief and destruction game<br>\ud83e\udd20 Customizable Ragdoll Character to be braked",
